s=s===0?new A.Yf(j,h,A.a([new A.ff("1. Acceptance of Terms",'By downloading, installing, or using the Contessa mobile application ("App"), you ("User") agree to be bound by these Terms of Service ("Terms"). If you do not agree, you must not use the App.\n\nThese Terms constitute a legally binding agreement between you and Pegasi Labs LLC, a limited liability company operating under the trade name "Contessa" (d/b/a Contessa) ("Company," "we," "us," or "our"). We reserve the right to modify these Terms at any time. Continued use of the App after modifications constitutes acceptance of the revised Terms.'),new A.ff("2. Description of Service",'Contessa is a maternal health companion application designed to help users during pregnancy and the postpartum period. The App provides:\n\u2022 Symptom tracking and pattern logging\n\u2022 AI-assisted health information ("Tessa AI") based on user-provided data\n\u2022 Appointment preparation and advocacy support\n\u2022 Educational content related to maternal health\n\u2022 Care facility information\n\nTHE APP IS NOT A MEDICAL DEVICE, MEDICAL SERVICE, OR SUBSTITUTE FOR PROFESSIONAL MEDICAL CARE. Tessa AI is an informational tool only.'),new A.ff("3. Medical Disclaimer","IMPORTANT \u2014 PLEASE READ CAREFULLY:\n\nThe Contessa App and Tessa AI do NOT provide medical advice, diagnosis, or treatment. All content generated by Tessa AI is for informational and general wellness purposes only and must not be interpreted as medical advice.\n\nYou should ALWAYS:\n\u2022 Seek advice from a qualified healthcare professional for medical questions\n\u2022 Call your local emergency services or go to your nearest emergency department in a medical emergency\n\u2022 Never disregard professional medical advice because of information provided by this App\n\u2022 Never delay seeking professional medical care based on App content\n\nPegasi Labs LLC (d/b/a Contessa) expressly disclaims all liability for clinical outcomes, misuse of information, or reliance on App-generated content in place of professional medical care."),new A.ff("4. Tessa AI \u2014 Artificial Intelligence Limitations","Tessa AI is powered by third-party large language model technology. You acknowledge and agree that:\n\u2022 Tessa AI may produce inaccurate, incomplete, or outdated information\n\u2022 Tessa AI responses are not reviewed by medical professionals in real time\n\u2022 Tessa AI cannot account for your full medical history unless you provide it\n\u2022 Tessa AI is not a licensed healthcare provider and has no duty of care\n\u2022 AI-generated content should be verified with your healthcare provider before acting on it\n\u2022 The Company makes no warranties regarding the accuracy or fitness for purpose of AI responses"),new A.ff("5. User Data and AI Personalization","To provide personalized support, Tessa AI may access and process the following data you have voluntarily entered into the App:\n\u2022 Symptom logs and severity ratings\n\u2022 Mood and energy tracking entries\n\u2022 Pregnancy stage and gestational age\n\u2022 Medication and supplement records\n\u2022 Profile information (name, stage, weeks pregnant)\n\u2022 Prior conversation history with Tessa AI\n\nThis data is used solely to improve the relevance and quality of Tessa AI's responses within your session. You consent to this processing by using the Tessa AI chat feature. You may withdraw consent at any time by deleting your data in Settings or contacting us at thecontessaapp@gmail.com."),new A.ff("6. Eligibility","You must be at least 18 years of age to use this App. By using the App, you represent and warrant that you meet this age requirement. The App is intended for adult users in supported jurisdictions. Use in any jurisdiction remains subject to applicable local laws."),new A.ff("7. User Accounts and Security","You are responsible for maintaining the confidentiality of your account credentials. You agree to notify us immediately at thecontessaapp@gmail.com if you suspect unauthorized access. The Company is not liable for loss or damage arising from unauthorized use of your account."),new A.ff("8. Subscription Tiers and Billing","Contessa offers a Free tier and a Premium paid tier. Premium subscriptions are billed through the applicable app store (Apple App Store or Google Play Store). Subscription fees are non-refundable except as required by applicable law. Cancellation of a subscription does not entitle you to a refund for the current billing period. The Company reserves the right to change pricing with 30 days' notice."),new A.ff("9. Prohibited Uses","You agree not to:\n\u2022 Use the App to provide medical advice to third parties\n\u2022 Misrepresent AI-generated content as professional medical advice\n\u2022 Attempt to reverse-engineer or extract the underlying AI model\n\u2022 Use the App in a manner that could harm yourself or others\n\u2022 Upload false, misleading, or harmful health data\n\u2022 Violate any applicable local, state, or federal law"),new A.ff("10. Intellectual Property","All content, trademarks, logos, and software in the App are owned by or licensed to Pegasi Labs LLC (d/b/a Contessa). You are granted a limited, non-exclusive, non-transferable license to use the App for personal, non-commercial purposes. You may not copy, modify, distribute, or create derivative works."),new A.ff("11. Limitation of Liability","TO THE MAXIMUM EXTENT PERMITTED BY APPLICABLE LAW, CONTESSA HEALTH INC. AND ITS OFFICERS, DIRECTORS, EMPLOYEES, AND AGENTS SHALL NOT BE LIABLE FOR ANY INDIRECT, INCIDENTAL, SPECIAL, CONSEQUENTIAL, OR PUNITIVE DAMAGES, INCLUDING BUT NOT LIMITED TO LOSS OF HEALTH, LOSS OF LIFE, PERSONAL INJURY, MEDICAL EXPENSES, OR LOST DATA ARISING OUT OF OR RELATED TO YOUR USE OF, OR INABILITY TO USE, THE APP OR TESSA AI, EVEN IF THE COMPANY HAS BEEN ADVISED OF THE POSSIBILITY OF SUCH DAMAGES.\n\nOUR AGGREGATE LIABILITY TO YOU FOR ANY CLAIMS ARISING OUT OF THESE TERMS OR YOUR USE OF THE APP SHALL NOT EXCEED THE GREATER OF (A) THE AMOUNT YOU PAID US IN THE 12 MONTHS PRECEDING THE CLAIM OR (B) USD $50."),new A.ff("12. Indemnification","You agree to indemnify, defend, and hold harmless Pegasi Labs LLC (d/b/a Contessa) and its affiliates from and against any claims, liabilities, damages, losses, and expenses, including reasonable legal fees, arising out of or in any way connected with your access to or use of the App, your violation of these Terms, or your violation of any third-party rights."),new A.ff("13. Governing Law and Dispute Resolution",A.coe(q)),new A.ff("14. Termination","We may suspend or terminate your account at any time for violation of these Terms, with or without notice. You may delete your account at any time via Settings. Upon termination, your right to use the App ceases immediately. Sections 3, 4, 5, 10, 11, 12, and 13 survive termination."),new A.ff("15. Contact","Pegasi Labs LLC (d/b/a Contessa)\nEmail: thecontessaapp@gmail.com\nSupport: thecontessaapp@gmail.com\nPrivacy: thecontessaapp@gmail.com")],r),k):new A.Yf(i,h,A.a([new A.ff("1. Introduction",'Pegasi Labs LLC, operating under the trade name Contessa (d/b/a Contessa) ("we," "us," or "our"), is committed to protecting the privacy of users ("you") of the Contessa App. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, disclose, and protect your personal and health information in compliance with:\n\u2022 California Consumer Privacy Act (CCPA) and California Privacy Rights Act (CPRA)\n\u2022 Children\'s Online Privacy Protection Act (COPPA)\n\u2022 CAN-SPAM Act (email communications)\n\u2022 Health Insurance Portability and Accountability Act (HIPAA) \u2014 note: Contessa is not a HIPAA-covered entity; health data you voluntarily enter is governed by this Policy, not HIPAA\n\u2022 State privacy laws applicable to your state of residence\n\u2022 Apple App Store and Google Play privacy guidelines'),new A.ff("2. Information We Collect","We collect the following categories of information:\n\nACCOUNT INFORMATION\n\u2022 Name, email address, and password (hashed)\n\u2022 Pregnancy stage, gestational age, and postpartum status\n\nHEALTH DATA (voluntary, entered by you)\n\u2022 Symptoms, severity ratings, and symptom logs\n\u2022 Mood and energy levels\n\u2022 Medications and supplements\n\u2022 Baby movement and feeding logs\n\u2022 Notes you add to your health records\n\nAI CHAT DATA\n\u2022 Messages you send to Tessa AI\n\u2022 Conversation history and session metadata\n\nUSAGE DATA\n\u2022 App feature usage, session duration, and navigation patterns\n\u2022 Device type, operating system version, and crash reports\n\u2022 App version and locale settings\n\nWe do NOT collect your location without explicit permission. We do NOT access your camera, microphone, or contacts unless you initiate those features."),new A.ff("3. How We Use Your Information","We use your information for the following purposes:\n\na) PROVIDING AND PERSONALIZING THE SERVICE\nYour health data (symptoms, mood, profile, medications) is used to personalize Tessa AI's responses and provide context-aware support. This is core to the App's function.\n\nb) AI PROCESSING\nWhen you interact with Tessa AI, your recent health data and conversation history are included in prompts sent to our AI provider (OpenAI, Inc.) to generate personalized responses. OpenAI processes this data subject to its API data usage policies, which prohibit training on API inputs unless you opt in separately. We do not sell your data to OpenAI.\n\nc) IMPROVING THE APP\nAnonymized and aggregated usage analytics help us improve features and fix issues. We do not use identifiable health data for product improvement without explicit consent.\n\nd) COMMUNICATIONS\nWe may send transactional emails (account creation, password reset). We will not send marketing communications without your opt-in consent in accordance with the CAN-SPAM Act and applicable state laws.\n\ne) LEGAL COMPLIANCE\nWe may process data to comply with legal obligations or respond to lawful requests from authorities."),new A.ff("4. Health Information and Sensitive Data","YOUR HEALTH DATA IS SENSITIVE. We treat it accordingly:\n\u2022 Health data is encrypted in transit (TLS 1.3) and at rest (AES-256)\n\u2022 Health data is stored in Supabase infrastructure hosted in data centres that comply with SOC 2 Type II standards\n\u2022 We implement role-based access controls; no employee accesses your health data without authorization\n\u2022 We do not sell, rent, or share your individually identifiable health information with advertisers, data brokers, or third parties for marketing purposes\n\nCONSENT WITHDRAWAL: You may withdraw consent to health data processing at any time by deleting your data in Settings or emailing thecontessaapp@gmail.com. Withdrawal will not affect the lawfulness of processing before withdrawal."),new A.ff("5. Data Sharing and Third Parties","We share data only with:\n\na) AI PROVIDER: OpenAI, Inc. \u2014 processes conversation and health context data to generate Tessa AI responses. Subject to OpenAI's API usage policies (openai.com/policies).\n\nb) INFRASTRUCTURE PROVIDER: Supabase, Inc. \u2014 provides our database, authentication, and storage infrastructure.\n\nc) ANALYTICS: We may use privacy-respecting, aggregated analytics tools (no third-party ad tracking).\n\nd) LEGAL REQUIREMENTS: We may disclose data if required by law, court order, or to protect the safety of users.\n\ne) BUSINESS TRANSFERS: In the event of a merger, acquisition, or asset sale, your data may be transferred. We will notify you and provide opt-out options to the extent required by law.\n\nWe do NOT share your individually identifiable health data with insurance companies, employers, or advertising networks."),new A.ff("6. Data Retention","\u2022 Account and profile data: retained while your account is active, then deleted within 90 days of account closure\n\u2022 Health logs (symptoms, mood, baby data): retained while your account is active; you may delete individual entries at any time in-app\n\u2022 Chat history: Free tier retains up to 20 conversations; Premium tier retains unlimited history; you may delete any session at any time\n\u2022 Anonymized analytics: retained for up to 2 years for product improvement"),new A.ff("7. Your Privacy Rights",A.cog(q)),new A.ff("8. Children's Privacy","The App is not directed to individuals under 18 years of age. We do not knowingly collect personal information from minors. If you believe a minor has provided us with personal information, contact us at thecontessaapp@gmail.com and we will delete it promptly."),new A.ff("9. Data Security","We implement industry-standard security measures:\n\u2022 TLS 1.3 encryption for all data in transit\n\u2022 AES-256 encryption for data at rest\n\u2022 Row-level security on all database tables (users can only access their own data)\n\u2022 Secure authentication via Supabase Auth (bcrypt password hashing)\n\u2022 Regular security reviews\n\nNo method of transmission over the internet is 100% secure. While we strive to use commercially acceptable means to protect your data, we cannot guarantee absolute security."),new A.ff("10. Cookies and Tracking","The App does not use advertising cookies or cross-site tracking technologies. We may use essential session tokens required for authentication. The web version of the App may use local storage for session management only."),new A.ff("11. International Data Transfers","Your data is stored and processed in the United States. If you access the App from outside the United States, you consent to the transfer of your information to the United States, which may have different data protection laws than your country of residence. We take contractual and technical measures to ensure your data receives adequate protection."),new A.ff("12. Changes to This Policy","We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. We will notify you of material changes via in-app notification or email. Your continued use of the App after notification constitutes acceptance of the revised Policy. The version date at the top of this document indicates when it was last updated."),new A.ff("13. Contact & Complaints","For privacy inquiries:\nPegasi Labs LLC (d/b/a Contessa)\nEmail: thecontessaapp@gmail.com\n\nIf you are unsatisfied with our response, you have the right to lodge a complaint with the applicable privacy authority:\n\u2022 California: California Privacy Protection Agency (cppa.ca.gov) or Attorney General (oag.ca.gov/privacy)\n\u2022 Federal Trade Commission (FTC): ftc.gov/privacy\n\u2022 Your state Attorney General's office")],r),k)
